From 1cc70f1c1ae5b131f63f152f9b2232d83315ce76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jochem Kuipers <jochem@kuipers.cc>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 01:36:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] android: ARMeilleure delegate registry for NativeAOT JIT
 helpers

Ported from Kenji-NX libryujinx_bionic: under ANDROID, JIT helper calls use
explicit delegate function pointers instead of UnmanagedCallersOnly +
MethodHandle.GetFunctionPointer(), which NativeAOT cannot rely on.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
